1
00:00:00,950 --> 00:00:02,387
This ship had

2
00:00:02,437 --> 00:00:05,197
every plank replaced…

3
00:00:05,247 --> 00:00:07,275
one by one.

4
00:00:07,795 --> 00:00:09,109
The sail.

5
00:00:09,159 --> 00:00:10,601
The mast.

6
00:00:10,651 --> 00:00:12,539
Until nothing original

7
00:00:12,589 --> 00:00:13,834
was left.

8
00:00:14,284 --> 00:00:15,534
But someone kept

9
00:00:15,584 --> 00:00:16,769
the old planks…

10
00:00:16,819 --> 00:00:18,329
and built them back

11
00:00:18,379 --> 00:00:19,369
into a ship.

12
00:00:19,419 --> 00:00:20,988
So which one

13
00:00:21,038 --> 00:00:22,753
is the real one?

14
00:00:23,313 --> 00:00:25,164
Now look at her.

15
00:00:25,214 --> 00:00:26,152
Most of what

16
00:00:26,202 --> 00:00:27,262
she's made of…

17
00:00:27,312 --> 00:00:28,958
will be replaced.

18
00:00:29,930 --> 00:00:32,378
Her beliefs will change.

19
00:00:32,428 --> 00:00:34,862
Her friends will change.

20
00:00:34,912 --> 00:00:36,707
Even her memories

21
00:00:36,757 --> 00:00:37,666
will quietly

22
00:00:37,716 --> 00:00:39,473
rewrite themselves.

23
00:00:39,898 --> 00:00:41,223
So is she still

24
00:00:41,273 --> 00:00:42,323
the girl who

25
00:00:42,373 --> 00:00:44,168
stood here first?

26
00:00:46,309 --> 00:00:47,426
If every part

27
00:00:47,476 --> 00:00:48,730
of you changes…

28
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:50,313
what is it

29
00:00:50,363 --> 00:00:52,267
that stays you?

